    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C03_Mercedes_03:SubEv_C03_Mercedes_03_016:1da7d18a",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_SubEv_C03_Mercedes_03",
        "key": "SubEv_C03_Mercedes_03_016",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C03_Mercedes_03:SubEv_C03_Mercedes_03_016:1da7d18a",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C03_Mercedes_03:SubEv_C03_Mercedes_03_016:1da7d18a",
        "jp_sha256": "d00125cd8a1061b8c266525ec6da82aa8cd3ce43d735781337526f167742d510",
        "official_en_sha256": "f5683501b6dd9a631258fcccd251214a03815a3bddd3a647a31a930c0520bf98"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ええ、話し合いの土俵にも\r\n立たせてもらえませんでした……",
        "official_en": "Yes. It appears they are unwilling to engage in any and all negotiations as it stands.",
        "real_en": "Yes... They wouldn't even give us a chance to negotiate."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
