        "official_en": "We’re doin’ what we can ta survive. Ya <text style=\"italic\">really</> think askin’ nicely with a “pretty please” is gonna make us stop?",
        "real_en": "We're doing this to survive. You can't expect us to just say 'Sure' and stop, can you?"
